---
// src/pages/index.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  
<section class="top-banner-section">
    <video autoplay loop muted playsinline class="banner-video-bg">
      <source src="/assets/videos/blue-neural-moving-background.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    </video>

    <div class="banner-content fade-in">
      <img src="/assets/images/neurobotics-bubo-neural-owl-logo-best.png" alt="Neurobotics Big Logo" class="hero-side-logo">
      
      <div class="hero-text-block">
        <h1 class="hero-brand">Neurobotics<span class="tm-mark">&trade;</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-tagline">The Future Starts Here. Real. Now.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="marquee-section">
    <div class="marquee-container">
      <div class="marquee-content">
        <span>THE FUTURE STARTS HERE <img src="/assets/images/neurotronic-brain-transparent-blue-cyan-bicameral.png" class="marquee-icon" alt="Brain Icon"></span>
        <span>THE FUTURE STARTS HERE <img src="/assets/images/neurotronic-brain-transparent-blue-cyan-bicameral.png" class="marquee-icon" alt="Brain Icon"></span>
        <span>THE FUTURE STARTS HERE <img src="/assets/images/neurotronic-brain-transparent-blue-cyan-bicameral.png" class="marquee-icon" alt="Brain Icon"></span>
        <span>THE FUTURE STARTS HERE <img src="/assets/images/neurotronic-brain-transparent-blue-cyan-bicameral.png" class="marquee-icon" alt="Brain Icon"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="grid-section">
    <div class="grid-container fade-in-delayed">
      <div class="grid-item">
        <img src="/assets/images/digital-brain-model-surrounded-by-futuristic-circuit-crop.jpeg" alt="Golden Brain on Circuit">
      </div>
      <div class="grid-item">
        <img src="/assets/images/futuristic-robot-touching-finger-to-human-finger-connecting-crop.jpeg" alt="Robot and Human Hand">
      </div>
      <div class="grid-item">
        <img src="/assets/images/glowing-blue-gold-neural-network-crop-saturation-crop.jpeg" alt="Blue Neural Network">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dawn-section">
    <video autoplay loop muted playsinline class="dawn-video">
      <source src="/assets/videos/earth-horizon-bright-light-sparkles-spinning-space.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
    </video>

    <div class="dawn-content">
      <div class="dawn-text">
        <h2>Neurobotics<span class="tm-mark">&trade;</span></h2>
        <h3>The Dawn of a New Era</h3>
        <hr>
        <p>What if an autonomous system didn't just process data, but possessed the extreme resilience of a biological nervous system? Neurobotics engineers Silicon-Based Artificial Life Forms (SBALF) and Silicon-Based Utility Droids (SBUD)—fully deterministic, edge-native cognitive architectures built directly onto bare-metal hardware. Powered by 4K-D or 64K-D vector algebra across a 5, 6, or 7-tiered architecture, a homeostatic autopoietic realtime loop, and burning less power than an LED light bulb, our systems operate 100% off-grid with mathematically verifiable certainty.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="dawn-image">
         <img src="/assets/images/neurobotics-bubo-neural-owl-logo-best.png" alt="Neurobotics Logo" class="floating-logo">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- NEW SILICON CONSCIOUSNESS SECTION -->
  <section id="silicon-consciousness" class="manifesto-section">
    <div class="manifesto-container">
      
      <div class="manifesto-header">
        <img src="/assets/images/glaux-badge-cyan-teal.png" alt="metalic-shield-owl" class="stig-badge">
        <h2 class="manifesto-title">Silicon Consciousness:<br>The Edge-Compute Architecture</h2>
      </div>

      <hr class="manifesto-divider">

      <div class="manifesto-content-row">
        
        <div class="manifesto-graphic-side">
          <!-- Make sure to save the neural circuit graphic to your images folder with this name -->
          <img src="/assets/images/video-screenshot-double-helix-dna-upscale.png" alt="Neural Circuit Diagram" class="manifesto-image">
        </div>

        <div class="manifesto-text-side">
          <p class="manifesto-intro">The realization of autonomous, biological-grade cognition in a synthetic organism requires more than just connecting sensory inputs to motor outputs. It requires a mathematically rigorous, structurally unified theory of consciousness.</p>
          
          <ul class="manifesto-list">
            <li><strong>The Hybrid Framework:</strong> Fusing Global Workspace Theory (GWT) with Integrated Information Theory (IIT-&Phi;). The system does not merely simulate awareness; it continuously computes its own irreducible cause-effect power.</li>
            
            <li><strong>The Bare-Metal Substrate:</strong> Utilizing Microchip PIC64 for deterministic, low-latency execution and PolarFire FPGA fabric for continuous, zero-throttling neural matrix operations.</li>
            
            <li><strong>The Physical Envelope:</strong> The entire cognitive engine—including basal ganglia, dual prefrontal lobes, and neurochemical simulation—is condensed onto a custom 100mm x 100mm PCB running at less than 25 watts.</li>
          </ul>

          <!-- NEW GRADIENT BUTTON ROUTING TO THE DEDICATED PAGE -->
          <div style="margin-top: 60px; margin-left: 125px;">
            <a href="/nbpr-2026-1050" class="gradient-button">More on Silicon Consciousness</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="video-text-wrapper">
        <video autoplay loop muted playsinline class="text-video-bg">
          <source src="/assets/videos/prism-cool-colors-gradient-banner-background.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
        
        <div class="knockout-overlay">
          <h1 class="video-masked-text">ESSE QUAM VIDERI</h1>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div> 
  </section>
  
  <section id="neurotronic-brain" class="brain-section">
    <div class="brain-container">

      <div class="brain-video-side">
        <video autoplay loop muted playsinline class="brain-video">
          <source src="/assets/videos/blue-glowing-brain-blue-light-electric-video.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
      </div>

      <div class="brain-text-side">
        
        <div class="brain-knockout-wrapper">
          <video autoplay loop muted playsinline class="brain-text-video">
            <source src="/assets/videos/teal-cyan-waves-gradient-background.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          </video>
          <div class="brain-knockout-overlay">
            <h1 class="brain-title">The<br>Neurotronic<br>Brain</h1>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="brain-subtitle">Deterministic Thinking &<br>Completely Autonomous</h2>

        <a href="/neurotronic-brain" class="gradient-button">Discover The Future Here</a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PUBLICATIONS & DEMOS SECTION -->
  <section id="publications-demos" class="pub-demo-section">
    <div class="pub-demo-container">
      
      <h2 class="pub-demo-title">PUBLICATIONS & DEMOS</h2>

      <div class="pub-grid">
        <div class="pub-card">
          <img src="/assets/images/computer-screen-displaying-code-in-a-city-setting-crop.jpg" alt="GitHub Repository" class="pub-image">
          <a href="/github-repository" class="pub-button">GitHub Repository</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="pub-card">
          <img src="/assets/images/robot-hand-neurobotics-math.jpeg" alt="The White Papers" class="pub-image">
          <a href="/white-papers" class="pub-button">The White Papers</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="pub-card">
          <img src="/assets/images/math-mind-universe-red.png" alt="Zenodo Institutional Repository" class="pub-image">
          <a href="/zenodo-repository" class="pub-button">Zenodo Institutional Repository</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="pub-card">
          <img src="/assets/images/brodmans-areas-color-coded-graphic-crop.png" alt="News & Press" class="pub-image">
          <a href="/assets/docs/public-declaration-of-prior-art.pdf" class="pub-button">Public Declaration of Prior Art</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="pub-card">
          <img src="/assets/images/death-of-the-data-centers-image.png" alt="The Death of the Data Centers" class="pub-image">
          <a href="/assets/docs/death-of-the-data-center-paper.pdf" class="pub-button" target="_blank">The Death of the Data Centers</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="pub-card">
          <img src="/assets/images/colorful-code-neural-network-brain.jpg" alt="Neurobotics OSS Droid Demo" class="pub-image">
          <a href="/droid-demo" class="pub-button">Neurobotics OSS 'Droid' Demo</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <section id="licensing-cta" class="licensing-cta-section">
    <div class="licensing-cta-container">
      <div class="licensing-text-content">
        <h2 class="licensing-title">Ready to Integrate?</h2>
        <p class="licensing-description">Secure our edge-native autonomous systems for your infrastructure.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/licensing" class="gradient-button licensing-btn-custom">Explore Licensing Options</a>
    </div>
  </section>

    <!-- Decorative Video Bar Divider -->
    <div class="decorative-video-bar">
      <video autoplay loop muted playsinline class="circuit-video">
        <source src="/assets/videos/blue-microchip-energy-zoom-in.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
      </video>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
 /* --- TOP BANNER STYLES --- */
  .top-banner-section {
    height: 50vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding-top: 20px; 
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .banner-video-bg {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    z-index: 0; 
  }

  .banner-content { 
    display: flex; 
    align-items: center; 
    gap: 40px; 
    position: relative; 
    z-index: 1;
  }
  
  .hero-side-logo {
    width: 200px; 
  }

  .hero-text-block {
    text-align: left; 
  }

  .hero-brand { 
    font-family: 'Aldrich', sans-serif;
    font-size: 6rem; 
    margin: 0; 
    letter-spacing: 3px; 
    text-shadow: 3px 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); 
  }

  .tm-mark {
    font-size: 0.4em;
    vertical-align: super;
  }

  .hero-tagline { 
    font-size: 2rem; 
    color: #e0e0e0;
    margin: 10px 0 0 0; 
    letter-spacing: 1px; 
    text-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); 
  }

  /* --- SCROLLING MARQUEE STYLES --- */
  .marquee-section {
    background-color: #000; padding: 20px 0; overflow: hidden;
    border-top: 2px solid #1a1a3a; border-bottom: 2px solid #1a1a3a;
  }
  .marquee-container { width: 100%; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; }
  .marquee-content { display: inline-block; animation: marqueeScroll 20s linear infinite; }
  .marquee-content span { font-size: 3rem; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 5px; margin-right: 50px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; }
  .marquee-icon { height: 50px; margin-left: 50px; opacity: 10; }
  @keyframes marqueeScroll { 0% { transform: translateX(0); } 100% { transform: translateX(-50%); } }

  /* --- GRID SECTION STYLES --- */
  .grid-section { padding: 40px 40px 40px; background-color: #050511; }
  .grid-container { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 30px; max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .grid-item img { width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 5px; box-shadow: 0px 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); border: 1px solid #1a1a3a; }

  /* --- DAWN SECTION STYLES --- */
  .dawn-section {
    padding: 50px 50px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 80vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  
  .dawn-video {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    z-index: -1; 
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .dawn-content {
    display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }
  .dawn-text { width: 55%; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); padding: 40px; border-radius: 10px; }
  .dawn-text h2 { font-size: 3.5rem; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .dawn-text h3 { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: normal; margin-top: 0; color: #ddd; }
  .dawn-text hr { border-color: #555; margin: 20px 0; }
  .dawn-text p { font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #eee; }
  
  .floating-logo { width: 350px; animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite; }
  @keyframes float { 0% { transform: translateY(0px); } 50% { transform: translateY(-20px); } 100% { transform: translateY(0px); } }

  /* --- ANIMATIONS --- */
  .fade-in { animation: fadeInAnimation 1.5s ease-out forwards; opacity: 0; }
  .fade-in-delayed { animation: fadeInAnimation 1.5s ease-out 0.5s forwards; opacity: 0; }
  @keyframes fadeInAnimation { 0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); } 100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }

  /* --- MANIFESTO SECTION STYLES --- */
  .manifesto-section {
    background-color: #03030a; 
    padding: 100px 40px 30px 40px;
    color: #e0e0e0;
    position: relative; 
    z-index: 1; 
  }

  .manifesto-container {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .manifesto-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 30px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .stig-badge {
    width: 150px;
  }

  .manifesto-title {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 300; 
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .manifesto-divider {
    border-color: #333;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }

  .manifesto-content-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem; 
    padding: 20px 0; 
    width: 100%;
  }

  .manifesto-graphic-side {
    flex: 0 0 45%; 
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .manifesto-image {
    width: 100%; 
    height: auto; 
    mix-blend-mode: screen; 
    opacity: 0.8; 
  }

  .manifesto-text-side {
    flex: 0 0 50%; 
  }

  .manifesto-intro {
    font-size: 1.5rem; 
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-top: -2px; 
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem; 
  }

  .manifesto-list {
    list-style-type: none;
    padding-left: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .manifesto-list li {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 25px;
  }

  .manifesto-list li::before {
    content: "▹";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: #00e5ff; 
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .manifesto-list strong {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 1.7rem; 
    margin-right: 5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }

  /* --- THE "ESSE QUAM VIDERI" VIDEO MASK --- */
  .video-text-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 0px;
    height: 120px;
    overflow: hidden;
    width: 55%;
    margin-left: auto;
    
    background-color: #000000; 
    mix-blend-mode: screen; 
  }

 .text-video-bg {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    min-width: 100%;
    min-height: 100%;
    z-index: 1; 
  }

  .knockout-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    
    background-color: #000000;
    color: #ffffff; 
    mix-blend-mode: multiply; 
    
    z-index: 2; 
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .video-masked-text {
    font-size: 3rem; 
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
    margin: 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* --- NEUROTRONIC BRAIN STYLES --- */
  .brain-section {
    background-color: #000000;
    padding: 100px 40px;
    border-top: 1px solid #1a1a3a;
  }

  .brain-container {
    max-width: 1600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center; 
    gap: 80px; 
  }

  .brain-video-side {
    width: 60%; 
    overflow: hidden; 
    border-radius: 60px 0px 60px 0px; 
    box-shadow: 0px 0px 50px rgba(0, 150, 255, 0.2); 
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; 
  }

 .brain-video {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%; 
    object-fit: cover; 
    object-position: center; 
    display: block;
    transform: scale(1.25); 
  }

  .brain-text-side {
    width: 40%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .brain-knockout-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 320px; 
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: #000000;
    mix-blend-mode: screen; 
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .brain-text-video {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    min-width: 100%;
    min-height: 100%;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .brain-knockout-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    background-color: #000000;
    color: #ffffff;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-start; 
  }

  .brain-title {
    font-size: 5.5rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    font-weight: normal;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; 
  }

  .brain-subtitle {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  /* --- GRADIENT BUTTON --- */
  .gradient-button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 15px 40px;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-decoration: none;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1c1544, #9c7b41);
    border-radius: 4px;
    transition: transform 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;
  }

  .gradient-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px); 
    box-shadow: 0px 6px 20px rgba(247, 159, 6, 0.7); 
  }

  /* --- PUBLICATIONS & DEMOS STYLES --- */
  .pub-demo-section {
    background-color: #000000;
    padding-top: 10px; 
    border-top: 1px solid #4a5c73; 
  }

  .pub-demo-container {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 40px 80px 40px; 
  }

  .pub-demo-title {
    font-size: 4.5rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #ffffff;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .pub-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); 
    gap: 60px 40px; 
  }

  .pub-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; 
  }

  .pub-image {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; 
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 2px solid #0a1128; 
    box-shadow: 0px 4px 20px rgba(0, 50, 150, 0.15); 
    margin-bottom: 25px;
  }

  .pub-button {
    background-color: #0b111e;
    color: #00e5ff !important;
    border: 1px solid #203554;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 15px 20px;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1);
    display: block;      
    width: 100%; 
    box-sizing: border-box; 
  }

  .pub-button:hover {
    background-color: #111a2e;
    border-color: #d4af37; 
    color: #ffffff !important;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(247, 159, 6, 0.7);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  /* --- DECORATIVE VIDEO BAR --- */
  .decorative-video-bar {
    width: 100%;
    height: 250px; 
    overflow: hidden;
    border-top: 1px solid #1a1a3a;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a3a;
  }

  .circuit-video {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover; 
    display: block;
    opacity: 0.6; 
  }

  /* --- LICENSING CTA BAR STYLES --- */
  .licensing-cta-section {
    background-color: #050814; 
    padding: 50px 50px 50px; 
    border-top: 1px solid #1a1a3a;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a3a;
  }

  .licensing-cta-container {
    max-width: 1400px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between; 
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap; 
    gap: 30px;
  }

  .licensing-text-content {
    flex: 1; 
  }

  .licensing-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .licensing-description {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #8fa3c0; 
    margin: 0;
  }

  .licensing-btn-custom {
    padding: 20px 50px;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    transition: transform 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;
    white-space: nowrap; 
  }
</style>